# Recruitment Plan

## Status
In Progress

## Participant Segments

I will recruit participants across four behavioral segments:

- Individuals who have repeatedly booked fishing charter experiences
- Individuals who have booked a fishing charter for the first time within the past 6–12 months
- Individuals who have considered booking a fishing charter but did not complete a reservation
- Individuals who have planned or searched for group-based or special event activities

## Recruitment Channels

Participants may be recruited through:

- Marinas, docks, and beach access points
- Online boating and fishing communities
- Local social media groups
- Travel and experience platforms
- Review platforms and tourism-related discussions

## Screening Purpose

Screening questions will ensure participants fit the behavioral segments needed for the study.
